Package: bayescompRCranelift
Type: Package
Title: 'Cranelift' Native Code Backend for 'bayescompR'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam R", "Sophie", email = "adamrsophie@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS"))
Description: Compiles the typed intermediate representation of a 'bayescompR'
    model to machine code with the 'Cranelift' code generator and evaluates
    the log density and its gradient natively, with reverse mode automatic
    differentiation written in 'Rust'. Registers the backend "cranelift"
    with 'bayescompR'; the reference interpreter of the shared native
    runtime is available as a second engine for comparison.
License: GPL-3
Copyright: The bundled 'Rust' crates are listed with their authors and
    licenses in inst/AUTHORS.
URL: https://github.com/adamrsophie/bayescomp-native-rs
BugReports: https://github.com/adamrsophie/bayescomp-native-rs/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: bayescompR (>= 0.1.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.92, xz
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
